ing went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="div-separator-help-dropdown"></div></div></div><div class="section-help-page-2nd-fold-3"><div class="main-container helpp"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-120"><div class="div-block-p2-2"><div class="div-block-wrapper-legal hide help"><a href="#about-and-benefits" class="div-help-menu-heading top w-inline-block"><div class="not-selected">About and benefits</div></a><h3 class="heading-legal-2 extra hidecredit"><a href="#" class="link-legal-not-current-2">Credit Builder Credit Agreement</a></h3><div class="div-block-901 hideforrrnow"><h3 class="heading-selected-legal-left-2"><a href="#" class="heading-selected-legal-left-2 not-current">Credit Builder Credit Agreement</a></h3></div><div class="div-block-901 bottom hidefornow"><h3 class="heading-selected-legal-left-2"><a href="#" class="heading-selected-legal-left-2 not-current">Bright Capital Starter Line of Credit Agreement</a></h3></div><a href="#Eligibility-application-and-fees" class="div-help-menu-heading w-inline-block"><div class="not-selected">Eligibility, application, and fees</div></a><a href="#Loan-details-and-payments" class="div-help-menu-heading w-inline-block"><div class="not-selected">Loan details and payments</div></a><a href="#Communications-Reporting-and-Impact" class="div-help-menu-heading w-inline-block"><div class="not-selected">Communications, Reporting, and Impact</div></a><a href="#Closure-and-Cancellation" class="div-help-menu-heading w-inline-block"><div class="not-selected">Closure and Cancellation</div></a></div></div><div><div><div><h1 id="about-and-benefits" class="heading-help-main">About and benefits</h1></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="f8322a29-c11a-da69-3939-fd316bd737d8" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What is Bright Builder?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Bright Builder is a secured line of credit that helps you build credit history by reporting payment history. The product requires you to build a security deposit as low as $50 at a 0% interest rate and has no minimum credit score condition to apply.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="f8322a29-c11a-da69-3939-fd316bd737d8" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How does Bright Builder work?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Bright Builder creates additional payment history for you to build credit history.</p><ol role="list"><li>You get a secured loan of as little as $50 </li><li>To access the loan, you have to build a deposit of as little as $50</li><li>Once the deposit is complete, you get access to the secured loan</li><li>Spend the credit however you like</li><li>Pay back the minimum due every month</li><li>This monthly repayment builds your payment history</li><li>You build your credit </li><li>You can close your account if you want, and get your deposit back after clearing the outstanding balance</li></ol></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="f8322a29-c11a-da69-3939-fd316bd737d8" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How does Bright Builder differ from other Credit Building products in the market?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Here’s what makes Bright Builder different from other credit-building products:</p><ul role="list"><li><strong>0% APR. No interest fees:</strong> Unlike other credit building products, Bright Builder carries 0% APR. You can build credit history with Bright Builder with no interest fees at all!<br/>‍</li><li><strong>Reports to major bureaus:</strong> Bright Builder reports your payment history to major credit bureaus like Equifax and TransUnion. Most lenders use credit information from these two bureaus to give out loans and mortgages. <br/>‍</li><li><strong>No Minimum score to apply:</strong> At Bright, we believe everyone deserves better financial outcomes. We want to give people the opportunity to build their credit history by opening new opportunities. Everyone can apply for Bright Builder, irrespective of their score.<br/>‍</li><li><strong>Loan size as small as $50: </strong>With Bright Builder, you can start building credit history with a secured loan as small as $50. This makes it easy for you to pay back the loan without straining your budget!<br/>‍</li><li><strong>24x7 Real Customer Support: </strong>At Bright, we pride ourselves on providing excellent customer service. Our team is always available to answer your questions, provide support, and help you navigate the refinancing process via chat, email, or on-call.</li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="top-div"><div class="top"><h2 id="Eligibility-application-and-fees" class="heading-help-main eligibility-application-and-fees"><strong>Eligibility, application, and fees</strong></h2></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="5c1bc77c-c438-78b9-7a14-3f4b882db8aa" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Are there any fees associated with Bright Builder, such as application fees, origination fees, annual fees, or late fees?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li><strong>Application fees:</strong> There are NO fees while applying for Bright Builder.</li><li><strong>Origination fees:</strong> No, we do not charge any origination fees for Bright Builder.</li><li><strong>Annual fees: </strong>There are NO annual fees to use Bright Builder.</li><li><strong>Late fees: </strong>No, we do not charge any late fees.</li><li><strong>Membership fees: </strong> Bright does offer premium memberships, but membership is NOT compulsory to use Bright Builder.</li><li><strong>Closure fees: </strong>We do not charge any fees if you decide to close your Bright Builder.</li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="5c1bc77c-c438-78b9-7a14-3f4b882db8aa" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What are the eligibility requirements for Bright Builder?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>Being a U.S. citizen or a permanent resident</li><li>Being at least 18 years old</li><li>Complete the KYC verification </li><li>Being a resident of the states where we service Bright Builder</li></ul><p>*Meeting these requirements does not necessarily guarantee approval for Bright Builder.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="5c1bc77c-c438-78b9-7a14-3f4b882db8aa" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Is Bright Builder available in my state or region?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Currently, Bright Builder is only available in selected states. However, our team is working to make Bright Builder available to all the states of the USA.  </p><p><strong>Available in</strong></p><ul role="list"><li>Alabama, Alaska, Arizona, Arkansas, Colorado, Connecticut, District of Columbia, Florida, Hawaii, Idaho, Illinois, Iowa, Kansas, Kentucky, Massachusetts, Michigan, Minnesota, Mississippi, Montana, Nebraska, New Hampshire, New Jersey, New York, North Carolina, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, South Carolina, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Virginia, Wisconsin.</li></ul><p><strong>Not Available in</strong></p><ul role="list"><li>California, Delaware, Georgia, Indiana, Louisiana, Maine, Maryland, Missouri, Nevada, New Mexico, North Dakota, Ohio, Oklahoma, Oregon, South Dakota, Vermont, Washington, West Virginia, Wyoming.</li></ul><p>All secured revolving lines of credit are made by Bright Capital Inc., NMLS (2410428), subject to state residency. Bright currently does not offer secured revolving lines of credit through CBW Bank, Member FDIC to new customers.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="5c1bc77c-c438-78b9-7a14-3f4b882db8aa" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Will applying for Bright Builder affect my credit score?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>No, applying for Bright Builder does NOT impact your credit score. There is no credit check to apply. </p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="5c1bc77c-c438-78b9-7a14-3f4b882db8aa" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Does Bright Builder do a hard pull?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>No, Bright Builder does not do a hard pull.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="5c1bc77c-c438-78b9-7a14-3f4b882db8aa" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Can I apply for Bright Builder if I have bad credit or a low credit score?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Yes, at Bright we believe in better financial outcomes for everyone. You can apply for Bright Builder irrespective of your current credit score. Bright Builder is most effective for users with low or no scores.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="5c1bc77c-c438-78b9-7a14-3f4b882db8aa" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How do I apply for Bright Builder?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can apply for Bright Builder on Bright’s app or website.</p><p>To download the app, use this link - </p><ul role="list"><li><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.brightcapital.app">Google Play Store</a></li><li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/id1511043796">Apple App Store</a></li></ul><p>To apply on Bright’s website, using this link - <a href="https://app.brightmoney.co/">https://app.brightmoney.co/</a></p></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><h1 id="Loan-details-and-payments" class="heading-help-main sda-and-loan-info"><strong>Loan details and payments</strong></h1></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What is a secured line of credit?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>A secured line of credit and an unsecured line of credit work the same, with just one difference: a secured line of credit requires a security deposit upfront. This security deposit may be used as collateral in case you do not pay at least the minimum amount due on your credit line each month (similar to a deposit for your electric bill, for example). The deposit is usually equal to the credit limit on your line of credit.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How big of a  loan do I get through Bright Builder?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>With Bright Builder, you get a secured loan starting at $50.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What is the security deposit for Bright Builder?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Bright Builder offers a secured line of credit starting at $50. In order to access the loan, you have to deposit a fully refundable security amount of at least $50.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How do I complete my security deposit?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can complete your security deposit either by setting up monthly AutoPay as low as $10 per month or by manually depositing funds through the app.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Can I withdraw my money from Bright Builder while building the deposit?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Yes, you can withdraw your deposit anytime before the full $50 amount has been provided. Once a deposit of at least $50 has been funded, this activates your Bright Builder Account. If you would like to access your security deposit, you will need to first close the loan and pay off any outstanding balance. You can also use your deposit to pay off any outstanding balance on your Bright Builder Account.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Will withdrawing my money from Bright Builder while building a deposit affect my credit score?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>No, withdrawing money from Bright Builder while building a deposit will not affect your credit score at all. However, we recommend you do not withdraw your Bright Builder deposit. This ensures you get access to the $50 loan quicker, enabling you to build additional payment history faster.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How do I know if my security deposit is completed?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can view the progress of your security deposit anytime in the Bright App. We will also send you an email informing you when you have saved the full $50 needed to activate the Bright Builder Account.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">When do I get access to my loan?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can access your loan once you complete the security deposit of $50.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Which banking partner do you work with?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Bright works with CBW Bank, Member FDIC to offer services for the secured line of credit. Bright also offers the Bright Builder loan direct in select states.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What can I use my Bright Builder $50 loan for?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can withdraw the $50 loan from the Bright app to a preferred checking account.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What would be my interest rate with Bright Builder? / Does Bright Builder charge any interest?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Bright Builder does not charge any interest fees, it is 0% APR.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">When can I withdraw my security deposit ?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>If you could like to access your security deposit, you will need to first close the loan and pay off any outstanding balance. You can also use your deposit to pay off any outstanding balance on your Bright Builder Account.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How do I withdraw money from the Bright Builder Account?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can log in to the Bright app and withdraw your money from the Bright Builder Account.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Where can I deposit money from the Builder Account?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can withdraw your money to the checking account of your choice. You would have to link the checking account with Bright where you want your money to be withdrawn.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What is the maximum amount I can withdraw?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>While building your deposit, you can withdraw the current deposit amount.</p><p>Post the loan origination, you can withdraw as much as your remaining credit limit.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How can I access my Bright Builder Account?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can log in to the Bright app and see your secured line of Credit.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What is my first draw amount?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>The first draw amount is the first disbursement you will get after completing the deposit. You can select your first draw amount to be any value ranging from $0 to the credit limit. You will be asked to choose your disbursement amount during the onboarding flow and can change this inside the Bright app or by reaching out to customer support.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Why does Bright recommend the first draw to be $20?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>We recommend keeping your first draw amount to $20 to prevent high utilization. However, you can choose your desired amount ranging from $0 to the credit limit.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Can I change my first draw amount?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Yes, you can change your first draw amount in the Bright app.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How can I set up AutoPay for monthly minimum-due payments for Bright Builder?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>During onboarding, you can choose  if you would like to set up Auto Pay for your monthly payments. You can also change this preference from inside the app or through customer support.</p><p>Setting up Auto Pay is not required and you can also choose to make monthly payments via the app.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Can I manually pay my Minimum due?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Yes, you can manually pay your minimum due through the app.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How can I pay my Minimum due?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can log in to the Bright app and manually pay your Minimum due from the checking account of your choice. Alternatively, you can also contact Bright’s customer support to pay your Min due</p><p>Please reach out to Bright’s Customer Support via: </p><ul role="list"><li><strong>24x7 Chat support</strong>: Through your Bright Money App</li><li><strong>Email</strong>: Write to us at <a href="mailto:support@brightmoney.co">support@brightmoney.co</a> </li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> Call us at +1 (877) 274-6494</li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Can I make an early payment on the Bright Builder Account or pay for next month in advance?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can make payments on your Bright Builder account for the current month up to the total balance outstanding.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Can I pay off my Bright Builder Account early?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Yes, you can pay off your Bright Builder account in full at any time.</p><p>To build payment history over a period of time, we suggest you continue using Bright Builder for at least 10-12 months.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="657a7661-6303-6a21-1fcd-409b0c7c7706" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Is AutoPay required for my Credit Builder loan?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><ol start="" role="list"><li>No AutoPay is NOT required for your Credit Builder loan. You can make payments in the app or by contacting customer support.</li><li>If you could like to enable AutoPay you can do so during the onboarding process, from the app or by contacting Customer Support.</li></ol></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><h1 id="Communications-Reporting-and-Impact" class="heading-help-main communications-reporting-and-impact"><strong>Communications, Reporting, and Impact</strong></h1></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What communications can I expect from Bright?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>We send you communications for the following:</p><ol role="list"><li>Origination of loan ( completion of security deposit)</li><li>Disbursement of loan</li><li>Monthly bill statements</li><li>Monthly bill payment reminder</li><li>Late payment reminders</li><li>When reporting to credit bureaus</li></ol></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Do you send minimum payment/bill reminders?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Yes, Bright sends you bill/minimum payment reminders via email every month.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Do you send late payment reminders?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Yes, Bright sends you a late payment reminder email every month.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Do I get to know when my payments are reported to the credit bureaus?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Yes, Bright sends you an email when we report your payments to the credit bureaus.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Which bureaus do you report to?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>We report to the major credit bureaus - Equifax and TransUnion.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">When will the Bright Builder account appear on the Credit Report?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Bright Builder reports to the major credit bureaus 30 days after your statement&#x27;s due date.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How much of a boost will I get from Bright Builder?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Payment history has the biggest impact on credit score accounting for 40% of how the score is calculated as per TransUnion (https://www.transunion.com/credit-score). Bright Builder helps you build payment history that may positively improve your credit score.</p><p>A credit score increase is not guaranteed. Individual results may vary. Late payments, missed payments, or other defaults on your account with us or others will have a negative effect on your credit score.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Will Bright Builder report missed payments?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>If your balance due is not paid in full after 30 days from the due date, we reserve the right to report information about your account to the major credit bureaus. Late payments, missed payments, or other defaults on your account may be reflected on your credit report.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What if I can’t pay back my Bright Builder loan?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You always have the option to close your account by using your deposit to clear any outstanding balance you might have and get the remaining amount back into your checking account.</p><p>If you are having payment difficulties or want to discuss your upcoming payments please contact the Bright Customer Support team. </p><p>Please reach out to Bright’s Customer Support via: </p><ul role="list"><li><strong>24x7 Chat support</strong>: Through your Bright Money App</li><li><strong>Email</strong>: Write to us at <a href="mailto:support@brightmoney.co">support@brightmoney.co</a> </li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> Call us at +1 (877) 274-6494</li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Will Bright Builder affect my score negatively?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><ol start="" role="list"><li>Payment history has the biggest impact on credit score accounting for 40% of how the score is calculated per TransUnion (<a href="https://www.transunion.com/credit-score">https://www.transunion.com/credit-score</a>). Bright Builder helps you build payment history that may positively improve your credit score if you complete regular on-time payments over time. This can be especially beneficial if you have limited credit history or are looking to rebuild your score.</li><li>A credit score increase is not guaranteed and if you do not make your payments on time, you credit score may decrease. Individual results may vary. Late payments, missed payments, or other defaults on your accounts with us or others will have a negative effect on your credit score.</li></ol></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How will my Bright Builder account reflect on my credit report?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Your Bright Builder account will reflect as Bright Capital Inc. or Bright/CBW on your credit report.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="8c1e1cfc-e170-4a72-b08e-f151cbb1814d" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How long does the Bright Builder program last?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Bright Builder is a secured line of credit that remains open while a user is in good standing.</p><p>We recommend continuing with Bright Builder for at least 10-12 months. If you achieve your desired progress you can close your Bright Builder anytime.</p><p>The product has a 3-year draw period and a 1-year repayment period.</p></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><h1 id="Closure-and-Cancellation" class="heading-help-main closure-and-cancellation"><strong>Closure and Cancellation</strong></h1></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="becbfddd-a7e4-6390-f52f-4f793e137a46" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">How do I close my Bright Builder account?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>You can close your Bright Builder account from the Bright app or via Bright’s Customer Support. Bright will use your security deposit to clear any outstanding balance and then return the remaining amount to your linked checking account.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="becbfddd-a7e4-6390-f52f-4f793e137a46" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">What happens when the Bright Builder account closes?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>Bright will use your security deposit to clear any outstanding balance and then return the remaining amount to your linked checking account.</p><p>Bright will no longer report for you to the credit bureaus.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="becbfddd-a7e4-6390-f52f-4f793e137a46" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Does closing Bright Builder affect your score?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>If you close your Bright Builder Account in good standing, then we will no longer report payment history to the credit bureaus. While we can&#x27;t speculate on the exact impact of closing a Bright Builder Account on your credit score, payment history is regarded as the most important factor in determining your credit score.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="becbfddd-a7e4-6390-f52f-4f793e137a46" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Is there a fee involved in closing my Bright Builder account?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>No, there is no fee involved in closing your Bright Builder account.</p></div></nav></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="div-block-898 hidefornow"></div><div class="div-block-941"><div data-hover="false" data-delay="0" id="question" class="accordian-item-help help w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="becbfddd-a7e4-6390-f52f-4f793e137a46" class="accordian-toggle cutoff help1 w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="div-block-931 jobtitle minus"><h4 class="heading-166">Will canceling my membership affect Bright Builder?</h4><div class="w-embed"><style> .w-dropdown-toggle { white-space: normal; word-wrap: break-word; } </style></div></div><div class="div-block-935"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4d_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20%2B.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" style="display:block" alt="" class="image-positive expand"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68c3e3a7caa06b74af6898c6/68c3e3a7caa06b74af689a4c_Close%20and%20Expand%20Button%20-.svg" loading="lazy" style="display:none" alt="" class="image-minus"/></div></div><nav style="display:none;opacity:0" class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="customdescription change w-richtext"><p>No. Bright Builder is unrelated to Bright Membership. However, to see the best results, we strongly recommend that you keep an active Membership with Bright. The Bright Membership gives you many benefits such as the Card Manager, Debt paydown plan, Credit Monitoring, and 24*7 Live Support.</p></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-bottom"><div class="main-container"><div class="div-block-830 bottom"></div></div></div><section><div class="w-embed"><style>
